1
00:00:00,695 --> 00:00:04,325
(Raj:)-She won't notice they're missing?
-She doesn't know she takes them.

2
00:00:04,908 --> 00:00:08,998
(Leonard:)No, that's okay. It was something else
keeping me up last night.

3
00:00:09,162 --> 00:00:10,792
(Leonard:)And again this morning.

4
00:00:10,956 --> 00:00:13,496
(Leonard:)And I didn't mind.

5
00:00:17,671 --> 00:00:23,171
(Leonard:)I was up last night.
I was up this morning. I didn't mind.

6
00:00:23,343 --> 00:00:25,013
(Leonard:)Those are your clues.

7
00:00:29,349 --> 00:00:32,689
(Raj:)Ooh, ooh, did the pigeon
on your windowsill have more babies?

8
00:00:34,062 --> 00:00:37,062
(Raj:)-No.
-Were you making another Lego movie?

9
00:00:37,774 --> 00:00:39,234
(Raj:)-No.
-Because let me tell you:

10
00:00:39,401 --> 00:00:43,571
(Howard:)It's not enough to make the Legos move.
They also have to capture your heart.

11
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:45,910
(Leonard:)Okay, I'll give you one more clue.

12
00:00:46,074 --> 00:00:48,034
(Leonard:)It involved another person.

13
00:00:49,035 --> 00:00:51,075
(Raj:)Did you get a Japanese love pillow?

14
00:00:52,664 --> 00:00:55,504
(Howard:)How is a Japanese love pillow
another person?

15
00:00:55,709 --> 00:00:59,169
(Raj:)It is if you love her
and give her a name.

